# Pexels API key for stock-photo sourcing during deliverable assembly.
# Free tier: 200 requests/hour. Sign up at https://www.pexels.com/api/new/
# If missing or empty, the builder skips stock-photo fetching and falls back
# to colored SVG placeholders for hero images.
PEXELS_API_KEY=

# ---- GitHub App for the in-admin content editor ----
# Required to edit a published client's content in their Phase II site repo.
# Create a GitHub App under the CountingFive org with Contents: Read & Write,
# install it on the org, then fill these in.
#   GITHUB_APP_ID                 → App's numeric ID (from the App settings page)
#   GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY        → Private key PEM. Either paste the multiline
#                                   PEM directly, or paste a single line with
#                                   literal "\n" between rows (we'll expand).
#   GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID    → Installation ID (visible in the App's
#                                   installation URL: .../installations/{ID})
#   GITHUB_ORG                    → GitHub org slug, e.g. "countingfive"
GITHUB_APP_ID=
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY=
GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID=
GITHUB_ORG=
